      "statement": "The urfave/cli application is assembled in newApp() in internal/cmd/root.go, which wires default file writers and password prompters for go.step.sm/crypto, overrides the framework version and help printers with cli-utils/usage templates, sets app.Commands to command.Retrieve(), and enables bash completion.",
